loading_tips = PackedStringArray("Bedsheet Ghosts shiver before they fade: a faded ghost darts faster, but your shots still land.", "Pumpkin Heads wind up a lit pumpkin: a ring marks where it lands. Step out of it, or headshot the throw away.", "The boarding platforms either side of the skull are high ground with a long view down the plaza.", "The hall of mirrors has three doors: a quick way round the west side, and a place to break line of sight.", "When the lights go out, only the green lights stay on. Watch for glowing eyes.", "Ringmaster Rictus calls his spotlight down the plaza: get behind something before it sweeps over you.")
